# Theorist's Sanctum: "{2}{U}, {T}: Empower Jace 2." With no Jace planeswalker token, empower Jace creates a blue Jace
# planeswalker token with 0 loyalty and puts two loyalty counters on it. Bot1 beholds a Jace card in hand for the first
# Sanctum, pays for the empower with Black Lotus, and on turn 3 a second Sanctum beholds the token (a permanent: chosen, not
# revealed), so it enters untapped and nothing more is revealed than the Jace card of turn 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Theorist's Sanctum
Theorist's Sanctum
Black Lotus
Jace, the Mind Sculptor
Island x3
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Theorist's Sanctum.Play
Bot1.Choose(Jace, the Mind Sculptor)
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Theorist's Sanctum.Activate(Ability: Empower)
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Jace Token.Counters.Loyalty = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Theorist's Sanctum.Tapped = true
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Theorist's Sanctum.Play
Bot1.Choose(Jace Token)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Theorist's Sanctum#2.Tapped = false

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Jace Token.Types = Planeswalker
Bot1.Battlefield.Jace Token.Subtypes = Jace
Bot1.Battlefield.Jace Token.Counters.Loyalty = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Theorist's Sanctum#1.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Theorist's Sanctum#2.Tapped = false
Bot1.Revealed = Jace, the Mind Sculptor
